        "description": {
            "value": "<p><em>The Setup.</em></p><p>One creature within 30 feet attempts a Will save.</p><p><strong>Failure</strong> The target treats one creature of your choice within its reach as if it were you, and treats <strong>you</strong> as an ally, until the end of its next turn.</p><p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> As failure, for 2 rounds.</p><hr /><p><strong>Refined (9th)</strong> The failure effect also makes the target <strong>off-guard</strong> to the misidentified creature.</p><hr /><p><em>This is an illusion, a mental effect, and a visual one. It breaks the moment the illusion is contradicted by the GM's judgement.</em></p>"
